\f1\b\fs46 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \cb2 \strokec3 WHERE TO FIND IMPORTANT SETTINGS\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs32 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \cb2 Once you understand the hierarchy, the next thing to learn is where the settings outside the hierarchy live. Everything in Google Ads is in one of four places: Goals, Audiences, Tools, or Admin. Once you know which, you can find anything in 3 clicks.\cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa332\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs40 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \cb2 \uc0\u55356 \u57263  GOALS (left sidebar)\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs32 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \cb2 This is where you define what counts as a win.\cb1 \
\uc0\u8232 \cb2 What lives here:\cb1 \
\cb2 Conversions \'97 every action you're tracking (purchase, lead, signup)\cb1 \
\cb2 Conversion Summary \'97 performance of each conversion action\cb1 \
\cb2 Attribution \'97 which models you use (last-click vs data-driven)\cb1 \
\
\cb2 When to come here:\cb1 \
\cb2 Setting up a new conversion\cb1 \
\cb2 Checking if a conversion is firing correctly\cb1 \
\cb2 Changing what counts as the optimization target\cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa332\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs40 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \cb2 \uc0\u55357 \u56421  AUDIENCES (left sidebar)\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs32 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \cb2 This is where you build and manage who you target or observe.\cb1 \
\cb2 What lives here:\cb1 \
\cb2 Audience Manager \'97 your remarketing lists, customer match lists, custom segments\cb1 \
\cb2 Audience Insights \'97 who's actually converting (demographics, interests)\cb1 \
\cb2 Custom Segments \'97 keyword and URL based audiences for Display / PMax\cb1 \
\cb2 When to come here:\cb1 \
\cb2 Uploading a customer list\cb1 \
\cb2 Building a remarketing audience\cb1 \
\cb2 Reviewing who Google says is converting on your account\cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa332\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs40 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \cb2 \uc0\u55357 \u57056 \u65039  TOOLS (left sidebar or top menu)\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs32 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \cb2 Your utility belt \'97 anything that operates across multiple campaigns lives here.\cb1 \
\cb2 What lives here:\cb1 \
\cb2 Scripts \'97 automation code that runs on a schedule (Tools \uc0\u8594  Bulk Actions \u8594  Scripts)\cb1 \
\cb2 Bid Strategies \'97 portfolio bid strategies shared across campaigns\cb1 \
\cb2 Shared Library \'97 negative keyword lists, placement exclusion lists\cb1 \
\cb2 Business Data \'97 feeds (sitelinks, prices, callouts, dynamic ad targets)\cb1 \
\cb2 Asset Library \'97 images, videos, logos used in PMax / Demand Gen\cb1 \
\cb2 Bulk Actions \'97 upload changes via spreadsheet\cb1 \
\
\cb2 When to come here:\cb1 \
\cb2 Adding a script\cb1 \
\cb2 Building a negative keyword list to apply to multiple campaigns\cb1 \
\cb2 Bulk-uploading changes via CSV\cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa332\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs40 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \cb2 \uc0\u9881 \u65039  ADMIN (left sidebar, gear icon)\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs32 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \cb2 Account-level configuration \'97 anything that affects the whole account, not individual campaigns.\cb1 \
\
\cb2 What lives here:\cb1 \
\cb2 Account Access (User Access) \'97 who can log in and what permissions they have\cb1 \
\cb2 Billing \'97 payment method, invoices, promo credits\cb1 \
\cb2 Account Preferences \'97 time zone, currency, auto-tagging, notifications\cb1 \
\cb2 Account Settings \'97 account name, business info, communication preferences\cb1 \
\cb2 Linked Accounts \'97 Google Analytics, Merchant Center, YouTube, Search Console\cb1 \
\cb2 Sub-Account Settings \'97 manage child accounts (MCC only)\cb1 \
\cb2 When to come here:\cb1 \
\cb2 Granting a new user access\cb1 \
\cb2 Updating credit card or billing info\cb1 \
\cb2 Linking GA4 or Merchant Center\cb1 \
\cb2 Changing time zone or currency (warning: time zone is permanent)\cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa308\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs46 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \cb2 QUICK NAVIGATION CHEAT SHEET\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs32 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \cb2 Set up a conversion \uc0\u8594  Goals \u8594  Conversions \u8594  Summary\cb1 \
\cb2 Upload a customer list \uc0\u8594  Audiences \u8594  Your data segments\cb1 \
\cb2 Add a Google Ads script \uc0\u8594  Tools \u8594  Bulk Actions \u8594  Scripts\cb1 \
\cb2 Add a negative keyword list \uc0\u8594  Tools \u8594  Shared Library \u8594  Negative Keyword Lists\cb1 \
\cb2 Grant team member access \uc0\u8594  Admin \u8594  Account Access\cb1 \
\cb2 Update billing info \uc0\u8594  Admin \u8594  Billing \u8594  Settings\cb1 \
\cb2 Link Google Analytics \uc0\u8594  Admin \u8594  Linked Accounts\cb1 \
\cb2 Run a bulk upload \uc0\u8594  Tools \u8594  Bulk Actions \u8594  Uploads\cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa332\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs40 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \cb2 \uc0\u55357 \u56481  ONE SHORTCUT TO RULE THEM ALL\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs32 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf3 \cb2 The search bar at the top of Google Ads (or hit / on your keyboard) finds anything. Type "negative" \'97 it surfaces negative keyword lists. Type "billing" \'97 it jumps you to billing settings.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \cb2 When in doubt, search.\cb1 \
}